</table> <p style="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">In light of the vote on Proposal 4, the Board has determined that the Company will hold a Say-on-Pay vote each year until the next required vote on the frequency of <span style="white-space:nowrap"><span style="white-space:nowrap">Say-on-Pay</span></span> votes in 2029. </p> <p style="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><span style="text-decoration:underline">Proposal 5</span>: the approval of an amendment to the Charter to effect a <span style="white-space:nowrap"><span style="white-space:nowrap">5-for-1</span></span> &#8220;forward&#8221; stock split with a corresponding increase in the authorized number of shares of the Company&#8217;s common stock. The exact timing of the filing of this amendment, if any, will be determined by the Company. The final results of the voting were as follows: </p> <p style="font-size:12pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</p>
